# Analysis Endpoints
###############################################

### Video Processing - Extract pose landmarks from video
POST http://localhost:8001/api/v1/video/1/analyze/

### Audio Processing - Extract, normalize, and resample audio
POST http://localhost:8004/api/v1/audio/3/analyze/

### Pitch Analysis - Analyze pitch from processed audio
POST http://localhost:8005/api/v1/pitch/10/analyze/

### Volume Analysis - Analyze volume from processed audio
POST http://localhost:8006/api/v1/volume/9/analyze/

### Arm Movement Analysis - Analyze wrist kinematics and gestures
POST http://localhost:8002/api/v1/analyze/arm-movements/1/

### Eye Contact Analysis - Analyze gaze patterns
POST http://localhost:8003/api/v1/eye-contact/3/analyze/

### Hip Analysis - Analyze hip movement and sway
POST http://localhost:8007/api/v1/hip/3/analyze/

### Filler Words Analysis - Analyze filler words
POST http://localhost:8008/api/v1/filler-words/9/analyze/

